          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛ ɣän Puɔl, läät Yecu Kritho, kä ca cɔl kɛ ɣöö bɛ a jak, mi ca lɛ̈y go̱lä kɛ kui̱ thukni ti gɔw kɛ kui̱ Kuɔth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ci Kuoth kɛ lar ni wal kɛn thuk tin gɔw kɛ kui̱ Yecu kɛ thok gööknikɛ ce̱tnikɛ min cakɛ gɔ̱r kä Ruac Kuɔth in Rɛl Rɔ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ kɛn thuk ti gɔw kɛ kui̱ Yecu Gatdɛ, min la kuɛ̈ɛ̈ Dee-bid kɛ dieth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä kɛ ɣöö ca jɛ jiɛc li̱th, ca jɛ lat ɛn ɣöö ɛ Gat Kuɔth kɛ yiëë in rɛl rɔ rɛy bumä mi di̱i̱t. Kä ɛ jɛn Yecu Kritho Kuääran. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä kɛ Yecu Kritho Kuääran, ci Kuoth ɣä ka̱m cuɔ̱ɔ̱ŋ kɛ ɣöö bi ɣän a jääk kɛ ɣöö bä jur diaal nööŋ rɛy luthä ŋäthä kɛ kui̱ cio̱tädɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä yɛn tin cieŋ kä Röm ca yɛ cɔl bä kɛ ɣöö bi yɛn a nɛy Yecu Kritho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.1.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ɣän gɔ̱a̱rä yɛ mɛmɛ yɛn nɛɛ Kuoth diaal tin te kä Röm, tin nhɔkɛ kä cɛ cɔl kɛ ɣöö bikɛ a nɛɛkɛ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.1.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A puɔ̱th kɛnɛ mal Kuɔth in la Gua̱a̱ra kɛnɛ Kuäär ni Yecu Kritho tekɛ yɛ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.1.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Pal tɛthä lɔaac",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ nhiam, la̱rä Kuothdä tɛ̈th lɔaac rɛy Yecu Kritho kɛ kui̱dun yɛn diaal, kɛ ɣöö ca ŋa̱thdun lat rɛy ɣɔaa kɛɛliw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ ɣöö Kuoth in la̱tdä ikä kɛ yiëëdä kɛ latdä kɛ thuk ti gɔw kɛ kui̱ Gatdɛ, jɛn ɛ neendä kɛ ɣöö la yɛ a tiɛɛmä gua̱thni diaal rɛy palikä a thil pa̱k. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thiëcä, i̱ mi nhɔk Kuoth ɛ kɛ jɔak dɔ̱ŋ bɛ tekɛ gua̱a̱th mi bä kɛ ɣä kä yɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ ɣöö ɣän göörä jɛ ɛlɔ̱ŋ i̱ dëë yɛ nɛn, kɛ ɣöö dëë muc yieekä nyuak kɛɛl kɛ yɛ kä dëë yɛ bum. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä luɔtdä ni ɣöö banɛ rɔ̱ com kɛɛl kɛ ciaŋ ŋäthädan, ŋa̱thdun kɛnɛ ŋa̱thdä. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɣän göörä ɣöö bi yɛn ɛ ŋa̱c, dämaari kä nyiemaari, ɛn ɣöö cä ɣɔ̱n gua̱thni ti ŋuan, i̱ bä ben kä yɛ, duundɛ ɣöö tëëkɛ mi pen ɣä ben. Ɣän göörä ɣöö bä naath jakä ŋa̱th rɛydun ce̱tkɛ min cä la̱t rɛy Juri tin kɔ̱ŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɣän ta̱a̱ kɛ la̱t kɛ kui̱ ji̱ Gɛ-rith kɛnɛ Jur ti kueckɛ ciɛŋ ti com, kɛnɛ kui̱ nɛɛni ti pɛl kɛnɛ nɛy ti dɔa̱a̱r. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛ jɛn görä ɣöö dëë yɛ wä la̱t thuk ti gɔw kɛ kui̱ Yecu, ɔ yɛn nɛy tin te kä Röm.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.1.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Buɔ̱m thukni tin gɔw kɛ kui̱ Yecu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ ɣöö ɣän liakä rɔ kɛ kui̱ thukni tin gɔw kɛ kui̱ Yecu, kɛ ɣöö ɛ buɔ̱m Kuɔth kɛ kui̱ känä nɛɛni diaal tin ŋa̱th, kɛ kui̱ ji̱ Juudh kɛ nhiam cu mäni ji̱ Gɛ-rith bä. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ ɣöö ci thuk tin gɔw ɛ nyoth ɛn ɣöö ci Kuɔth naath la̱th rɛy cuŋni kɛ jɛ kɛɛl. Cɛ jɛ la̱t kɛ ŋa̱th ni tukä cu mäni guutdɛ, ce̱tkɛ min ca gɔ̱r",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1:17",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ɣäb 2:4.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " i̱, “Jɛn ram in tekɛ cuɔ̱ɔ̱ŋ bɛ tëk kɛ ŋa̱th.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.1.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Duer ji̱ ɣɔaa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ ɣöö ci waŋ lɔaac Kuɔth jɔɔc nhial kɛ kui̱ dui̱rä kɛnɛ jiäk nath tin ci ciaŋ dueerikiɛn thuɔ̱k nhiat piny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.1.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 1:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ ɣöö min dëë ŋa̱c kɛ kui̱ Kuɔth ca la̱t kɛ, kɛ ɣöö ci Kuoth ɛ nyuɔ̱th kɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.1.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 1:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni mëë ku Kuoth ɣɔw cak, ta̱a̱dɛ min ci jɔc, ala buɔ̱mdɛ min do̱raar kɛnɛ ciaaŋdɛ min rɛl rɔ, kɛn cikɛ jɔɔc kä tin cɛ la̱t. Kɛ kui̱c ɛmɔ kɛn nɛy ti̱ti̱ cikɛ thil cuɔ̱ɔ̱ŋ ɛn ɣöö deekɛ wee kueckɛ jɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.1.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 1:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛn ŋäc kɛn Kuoth kä /ken kɛn ɛ luɔ̱th ce̱tkɛ Kuoth kiɛ ka̱m tɛ̈th lɔaac. Kä cu ca̱riɛn cua̱ mi thil luɔt, kä cu ca̱r baaŋädiɛn cua ni muth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.1.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.1.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 1:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ruac kɛn i̱ pɛlkɛ, duundɛ ɣöö cu dɔ̱r ni kɛn, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.1.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.1.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 1:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kä cukɛ pal Kuɔth in tëk päl wa pal ni ti ca la̱t ce̱tkɛ naath, kɛ diit, kɛ ley, kɛnɛ muɔɔl piɛny tin la li̱w.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.1.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.1.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 1:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
