              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä kɛ kui̱ kä ɣöö cikɛ thuɔ̱k lo̱k kɛ kui̱ Kuɔth, ci Kuoth kɛ pa̱l ca̱r mi baŋ kɛ ɣöö bikɛ la̱t ni tin /ca dee la̱t. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.1.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.1.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 1:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cikɛ cu thia̱a̱ŋ kɛ ciaŋ dueeri diaal kɛ jiäk, kɛ di̱t lɔaac, kɛnɛ nyi̱r. Thiäŋkɛ kɛ tiɛɛl, kɛ luc nath, gak, kac, kaŋ, kɛ ji̱ guɛɛri, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.1.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.1.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 1:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ti ji̱ luɔm, nɛy ti nyiɛr kɛ Kuoth, kɛ jiääk thuɔk, ji̱ liakä, nɛy ti lar liakdiɛn, ji̱ ca̱a̱p jiäkni, nɛy ti thil luth kɛ diëëthkiɛn, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.1.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.1.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
